-    while the failed rank left: those then wait in their next agreement (H1's
-    review of #1218). Call it first in every sanctioned swallow that can see
+    while the failed rank left: those then wait in their next agreement (the
+    #1218 review). Call it first in every sanctioned swallow that can see
     an agreement point."""
